@startuml
title Distributed System Architecture

package "Distributed System" {
  node Client [
    Client Node
    Frontend
  ]
  node ServerA [
    Server A
    Primary Service
  ]
  node ServerB [
    Server B
    Backup Service
  ]
}

Client --> ServerA : Requests
Client --> ServerB : Fallback
ServerA --> ServerB : Replication
@enduml